msgstr "The journal creation form will open:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/journals.rst:65
msgid "Подробно см. :ref:`Создание нового журнала <new_journal>`."
msgstr "For details, see: :ref:`Creating a new journal <new_journal>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/journals/journals.rst:68
